{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Admin-only WebDAV HTTP adapter at /files/dav/<path>, rooted at runtime/files/shared. OPTIONS/Allow advertise exactly OPTIONS, PROPFIND, GET, HEAD, PUT, MKCOL, DELETE, COPY, MOVE; no LOCK/UNLOCK. Supports file/collection PROPFIND Depth 0/1, GET/HEAD, bounded PUT supplied by the listener, MKCOL, recursive DELETE (never the DAV root), and staged file/tree COPY/MOVE. Destination accepts origin-form or same-authority absolute http/https URI, Overwrite defaults to T and accepts exactly T/F. Both source and destination use resolve_path containment and symlink ancestry checks; tree writes reject nested links, same/containing paths, and missing destination parents. Statuses include 201/204, 400, 403, 404, 409, 412 and 500 for runtime failures. Test harness: tests/webdav-write-r1/verify.py in the newbound_files repo (authenticated curl assertions; not shipped as a library asset).","import":"use crate::files::files::propfind::propfind;\nuse crate::files::files::get_file::get_file;\nuse crate::files::files::put_file::put_file;\nuse crate::files::files::make_collection::make_collection;\nuse crate::files::files::delete_path::delete_path;\nuse crate::files::files::dav_tree::dav_tree;\nuse crate::files::files::resolve_path::resolve_path;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::file::mime_type::mime_type;\nuse std::path::Path;","params":[{"desc":"HTTP request method supplied by app.service.init.","name":"nn_method","type":"String"},{"desc":"Raw request path, expected to be /files/dav or a subpath.","name":"nn_path","type":"String"},{"desc":"HTTP request headers supplied by app.service.init.","name":"nn_headers","type":"JSONObject"},{"desc":"Raw HTTP request bytes supplied by app.service.init for non-POST requests.","name":"nn_body","type":"Any"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"lsknnh1a1ae3844ebuc9","readers":[],"time":1794357668972,"username":"system","writers":[]}